    },
    {
      "version": "2020.1",
      "releaseNotes": "This is our BIGGEST update ever!\nPete, the artist on Kepler Attack, has revamped the look of the game with exciting Tron style vector graphics and awesome animation.\n- Revamped asteroids, mines, enemies, hero ship and collectables!\n- New enemy ship types!\n- New icon!\n- Improved gameplay!\n- Enhanced visual effects!\n- New menu screen!\n- Improved Game Over screen with sharing on iPhone!\n- New Watch complications!\n\nThe new Modern theme is on by default, but you can choose the  classic Theme:\n- iPhone:  tap the Theme button to toggle between Modern and Classic\n- Watch: uncheck the \"Modern theme\" checkbox under the Options screen\n\nThanks for playing,\nJohnno and Pete",
      "seenAt": "2020-02-25T10:05:07Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2020.2",
      "releaseNotes": "- New look icon!\n- Minor tweaks and bug fixes\n\nThanks for playing,\nJohnno and Pete",
      "seenAt": "2020-03-09T20:17:25Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2020.3",
      "releaseNotes": "Welcome to another big update, featuring:\n- Brand new star field background with multiple layers of parallax!\n- Sound effects now play on Apple Watch!\n- Adjust the sound effect volume from the Settings screen (tap the cog)\n- Fixed issue where the last asteroid could take a while to come back on screen\n- We've also added a brand new icon!\n\nThanks for playing,\nJohnno and Pete",
      "seenAt": "2020-07-14T21:00:38Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2020.4",
      "releaseNotes": "Minor tweaks.\n\nPreviously!\n- Brand new star field background with multiple layers of parallax!\n- Sound effects now play on Apple Watch!\n- Adjust the sound effect volume from the Settings screen (tap the cog)\n- Fixed issue where the last asteroid could take a while to come back on screen\n- We've also added a brand new icon!\n\nCheers,\nJohnno and Pete",
      "seenAt": "2020-08-17T20:55:17Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2020.5",
      "releaseNotes": "- Fixed a bug where the review request could pop up too often.\n\nPreviously!\n- Brand new star field background with multiple layers of parallax!\n- Sound effects now play on Apple Watch!\n- Adjust the sound effect volume from the Settings screen (tap the cog)\n- Fixed issue where the last asteroid could take a while to come back on screen\n- We've also added a brand new icon!\n\nCheers,\nJohnno and Pete\n",
      "seenAt": "2020-08-21T21:22:07Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2020.6",
      "releaseNotes": "Renamed Asteroid Commando to Vesta Attack to match the game titles in the Space Watch trilogy -  Kepler Attack and Jupiter Attack.\nAlso, a new icon!\n\nEnjoy,\nJohnno and Pete",
      "seenAt": "2020-09-12T00:17:21Z"
    },
    {
